[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0010","text":"千雪，生日快乐！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0020","text":"────这样，只有一句话真抱歉啊，\n要是能准备点什么更好的就好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0030","text":"……制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0040","text":"这句话，就让我很开心……\n这句话比什么都让我开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10216002_00_0050","text":"谢谢您\n制作人……！"}]
